  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Beside Crescent Lake he shouts down Zhong tribe leader Zhong Fei You for seizing five black skin fat beetles that carry Chai tribe goods, and he names the trip as Chai tribe moving camp toward the heroes assembly. As Chai tribe’s leader of a small-scale tribe facing mid-scale Zhong tribe, he knows three of those beetles hold the tribe’s most precious goods gathered to side with Liu Wen Wu.",
      "chapters": [
        494
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_crescent_lake",
        "fac_zhong_tribe",
        "char_zhong_fei_you",
        "fac_chai_tribe",
        "char_liu_wen_wu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When Fang Yuan’s wolf group under the Chang Shan Yin name surrounds both camps, Chai Zhang and Zhong Fei You shift from near fighting to a shared urge to cooperate, then both retreat after Fang Yuan orders them out of the way.",
      "chapters": [
        494
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "retreat-before-chang-shan-yin",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_chang_shan_yin"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "From a distance he refuses elders who want to wait for leftovers, says staying risks Chang Shan Yin’s slaughter, and orders Chai tribe to leave Crescent Lake at once. The same stretch places that weak small tribe in the Northern Plains Imperial Court fight and coming blizzard, needing a stronger force to cling to for survival.",
      "chapters": [
        495
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "retreat-before-chang-shan-yin",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_northern_plains",
        "loc_imperial_court"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "At Liu Wen Wu’s heroes assembly matches, after Water Demon Hao Ji Liu kills Fire Prodigal Chai Ming with water image Gu methods, the Chai tribe leader cries out “Brother!!” as Chai Ming dies.",
      "chapters": [
        497
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "brother-at-the-heroes-assembly",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_hao_ji_liu",
        "char_chai_ming"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Earlier chapters already name Chai Zhang as that tribe’s leader on the road to the same assembly stretch.",
      "chapters": [
        494
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "brother-at-the-heroes-assembly",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
